{"t": 1794118102.0681202, "kind": "call", "tool": "slack_post_message", "args": {"channel_id": "C07INCID003", "text": "reports-api 502 \u2014 root cause found. CloudWatch /ecs/reports-api (eu-west-1) shows: `ERROR export failed: ValueError: dict contains fields not in fieldnames: 'currency'`, right after `INFO upstream ledger 2026.11 added currency to every row`. The CSV writer in reports/export.py had a fixed `id,amount` column list, so every export raised and the API failed. Fix: added `currency` to the export fieldnames; verified new rows export correctly and legacy rows without currency still work (empty column). Fix is in reports/export.py \u2014 needs deploy. Will watch error rate after rollout."}, "ok": true}
